==Strategy==
This stage can potentially catch you off guard, as Mr. Angel swarms can potentially be difficult to defeat. The solution isn't so easy either, as the best units, spammable area attackers, are likely going to be useful later, meaning you should save them.

One of the least useful of these attackers has to be The Flying Cat, as it's heavily outclassed typically, and here its weaken ability actually may see use.

